---
layout: page.njk
lang: ja
section: notes
slug: find
navId: find
title: "Noteを探す"
created: 2026-05-02
updated: 2026-05-02
summary: "Notesの記事を検索・タグ・並べ替えで探すページ"
permalink: "/{{ lang }}/notes/{{ slug }}/"
searchExclude: true
hero:
  image: "https://i.gyazo.com/a6e07600049875412da66a0ac4ca5351.png"
---
{% from "icon.njk" import icon %}
{% set notes = collections.all | notesForLang(lang, false, pageViews) %}
{% set hasViews = notes | notesHaveViews %}
<p>Notesセクションでは、FAQやトラブルシューティング、制作中に気づいた小さなメモ、ComfyUIに直接関係しない周辺記事などをまとめています。</p>

<section class="note-finder" data-note-finder>
  <label class="sr-only" for="note-finder-query">Notesを検索</label>
  <div class="note-finder__search">
    <span class="note-finder__search-icon" aria-hidden="true">{{ icon("search") }}</span>
    <input id="note-finder-query" class="note-finder__input" type="search" placeholder="Noteを検索" data-note-query autocomplete="off">
    <button class="note-finder__clear" type="button" data-note-clear hidden aria-label="検索をクリア"><span aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
  </div>

  <div class="note-finder__tags" aria-label="Tags">
    {% for tag in noteFinder.recommendedTags %}
      <button class="note-finder__tag" type="button" data-note-tag="{{ tag }}"><span class="note-finder__tag-prefix" aria-hidden="true">#</span>{{ tag }}</button>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

  <div class="note-finder__sort" role="group" aria-label="Notesの並べ替え">
    <button class="note-finder__sort-btn is-active" type="button" data-note-sort="updated" aria-pressed="true">Updated</button>
    <button class="note-finder__sort-btn" type="button" data-note-sort="views" aria-pressed="false" {% if not hasViews %}disabled aria-disabled="true"{% endif %}>Views</button>
  </div>

  <div class="workflow-related__grid" data-note-grid>
    {% for note in notes %}
      {% set heroImage = note.hero and note.hero.image or null %}
      {% set heroVariant = null %}
      {% if heroImage %}
        {% set heroVariant = heroImage | imageVariant(480) %}
      {% endif %}
      <a class="workflow-related__card" href="{{ note.url }}" data-note-card data-title="{{ note.title | lower }}" data-summary="{{ note.summary | lower }}" data-note-tags="{{ note.noteTags | join(' ') | lower }}" data-updated="{{ note.updated }}" data-views="{{ note.views or 0 }}">
        <div class="workflow-related__hero" {% if heroVariant and heroVariant.preview %}data-hero="{{ heroVariant.preview }}"{% endif %}></div>
        <span class="workflow-related__title">{{ note.title }}</span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  <p class="note-finder__empty" data-note-empty hidden>一致するNoteはありません。</p>
</section>
